const html=`<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>附件恢复完整性验证</title><style>body{font:15px/1.7 system-ui;max-width:850px;margin:35px auto;padding:20px}button,a{margin:7px;padding:8px}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#eef3fb;padding:18px}</style><h1>附件恢复完整性验证</h1><p>只操作本页新建的一份 6 MiB 合成待处理附件；不提交正文或上传文件。</p><a href="inline-writer.html">打开普通编辑器</a><button id="create" disabled>创建正确的测试附件</button><button id="corrupt" disabled>模拟同长度字节损坏</button><button id="restore" disabled>还原测试附件字节</button><button id="inspect" disabled>核对本机任务</button><button id="download" disabled>下载核对记录</button><pre id="state">正在确认本机测试范围…</pre><script type="module">
